---
// src/components/About.astro

// Tech stack actualizado con descripciones técnicas de uso
const techStack = [
    { name: "Burp Suite", desc: "Proxificado de tráfico Web, repeateo manual de requests y fuzzing de parámetros con Intruder." },
    { name: "Nmap", desc: "Descubrimiento de hosts, escaneo agresivo de puertos/servicios y uso de scripts NSE iniciales." },
    { name: "Python", desc: "Creación de scripts para automatizar payloads, fuerza bruta y exploits menores." },
    { name: "Bash", desc: "Oneliners potentes para post-explotación en Linux y automatización de pipelines de escaneo." },
];
---

<section class="flex flex-col gap-12 pt-16">
    
    <div class="text-center flex flex-col items-center gap-3" data-aos="fade-up">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-mono text-red-accent uppercase tracking-widest">01. Sobre mi</h3>
        <p class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tighter leading-tight">
            Curiosidad insaciable. <br/>
            Constancia absoluta.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        
        <div class="group relative md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1 p-8 rounded-3xl bg-bg-card border border-border-subtle overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:border-red-accent/40 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_10px_40px_-10px_rgba(225,29,72,0.15)]"
             data-aos="fade-up">
            <div class="absolute -bottom-16 -right-16 w-60 h-60 bg-red-accent/15 blur-[80px] rounded-full group-hover:bg-red-accent/25 transition-all pointer-events-none"></div>
            
            <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-5 h-full">
                <div class="w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-700 text-white">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h4 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Creciendo en EY</h4>
                <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed text-base">
                    Llevo <strong class="text-white font-medium">6 meses</strong> en el equipo, absorbiendo cómo funciona el pentesting corporativo real y estructurando auditorías profesionales bajo presión.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="group relative p-8 rounded-3xl bg-bg-card border border-border-subtle overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:border-red-accent/40 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_10px_40px_-10px_rgba(225,29,72,0.15)]"
             data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
            <div class="absolute -top-16 -left-16 w-60 h-60 bg-red-accent/10 blur-[80px] rounded-full group-hover:bg-red-accent/20 transition-all pointer-events-none"></div>
            
            <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-5 h-full">
                <div class="w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-700 text-red-accent">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2v10"/><path d="M18.4 4.6a10 10 0 1 1-12.8 0"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h4 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">CPTS en Curso</h4>
                <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed text-base">
                    Mi roadmap actual. No solo completo módulos en HackTheBox; me aseguro de entender profundamente cada concepto ofensivo antes de avanzar al examen.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="group relative p-8 rounded-3xl bg-bg-card border border-border-subtle overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:border-red-accent/40 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_10px_40px_-10px_rgba(225,29,72,0.15)]"
             data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
            <div class="absolute -bottom-16 -left-16 w-60 h-60 bg-red-accent/10 blur-[80px] rounded-full group-hover:bg-red-accent/20 transition-all pointer-events-none"></div>
            
            <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-5 h-full">
                <div class="w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-700 text-white">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="2" y2="22"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h4 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Hacker & Builder</h4>
                <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed text-base">
                    Lo que aprendo hoy, lo automatizo mañana. Creo mis propias herramientas (como PenMap) para optimizar mis tiempos de reconocimiento y explotación.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="group relative lg:col-span-2 p-8 rounded-3xl bg-bg-card border border-border-subtle overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:border-red-accent/40 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_10px_40px_-10px_rgba(225,29,72,0.15)] flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 md:items-center"
             data-aos="fade-up">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-red-accent/5 blur-[80px] rounded-full group-hover:bg-red-accent/10 transition-all pointer-events-none"></div>
            
            <div class="w-14 h-14 flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-700 text-white md:self-start">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" x2="8" y1="13" y2="13"/><line x1="16" x2="8" y1="17" y2="17"/><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/></svg>
            </div>
            
            <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-3 flex-grow">
                <h4 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Reporting Profesional</h4>
                <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed text-base max-w-2xl">
                    Sé que el hallazgo no sirve de nada si el cliente no lo entiende. Me enfoco en documentar mis Writeups y reportes de forma pulcra, clara y bajo estándares profesionales (usando PwnDoc).
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="group relative p-8 rounded-3xl bg-bg-card border border-border-subtle transition-all duration-300 hover:border-red-accent/40 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_10px_40px_-10px_rgba(225,29,72,0.15)]"
             data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
            <div class="absolute -top-16 -right-16 w-60 h-60 bg-red-accent/10 blur-[80px] rounded-full group-hover:bg-red-accent/20 transition-all pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>
            
            <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-5 h-full">
                <div class="text-sm font-mono text-zinc-500">Mi arsenal principal (hover para uso):</div>
                
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5 mt-auto relative z-20">
                    {techStack.map((tech) => (
                        <div class="group/tag relative"> <span class="px-3.5 py-2 text-sm font-mono text-zinc-300 bg-bg-main border border-border-subtle rounded-md group-hover/tag:border-red-accent/70 group-hover/tag:text-red-accent transition-colors cursor-help block">
                                {tech.name}
                            </span>

                            <div class="absolute bottom-full left-0 mb-3 w-72 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-950 border border-zinc-700 shadow-[0_15px_50px_-10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] 
                                        opacity-0 scale-95 pointer-events-none 
                                        group-hover/tag:opacity-100 group-hover/tag:scale-100 transition-all duration-200 z-50">
                                
                                <div class="absolute -bottom-4 left-6 w-20 h-20 bg-red-accent/15 blur-[40px] rounded-full -z-10"></div>

                                <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-2">
                                    <h5 class="text-base font-bold text-white tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
                                        <span class="text-red-accent">Uso:</span> {tech.name}
                                    </h5>
                                    <p class="text-sm font-mono text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
                                        {tech.desc}
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                                
                                <div class="absolute -bottom-1.5 left-7 w-3 h-3 bg-zinc-950 border-r border-b border-zinc-700 rotate-45"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    ))}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>